  "description": "DEXCUH crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R 3 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C82 H99 Co3 Gd3 N3 O27 1+,Cl1 O4 1-. From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Co1 (Co) has 4 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Co2 (Co) has 4 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Co3 (Co) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.376-4.047 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.25-117.65°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C88H131ClN3O41Co3Gd3. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
